 marks: marks[grid[r][c]].append((i,j))\\n    painted={2:set(),3:set()}\\n    for color,pts in marks.items():\\n        for a in range(len(pts)):\\n            for b in range(a+1,len(pts)):\\n                r1,c1=pts[a]; r2,c2=pts[b]\\n                if r1==r2:\\n                    for c in range(min(c1,c2),max(c1,c2)+1): painted[color].add((r1,c))\\n                if c1==c2:\\n                    for r in range(min(r1,r2),max(r1,r2)+1): painted[color].add((r,c1))\\n    out=[row[:] for row in grid]\\n    for i in range(nr):\\n        for j in range(nc):\\n            color=6 if (i,j) in painted[2] and (i,j) in painted[3] else 2 if (i,j) in painted[2] else 3 if (i,j) in painted[3] else 0\\n            if color:\\n                for r in range(rb[i]+1,rb[i+1]):\\n                    for c in range(cb[j]+1,cb[j+1]): out[r][c]=color\\n    return out\\n'''\n(base/'task-65de1075.py').write_text(code2)\nexec(code2); out=transform(grid)\nprint('\\n'.join(' '.join(map(str,r)) for r in out))","t":1792486385.4763682,"stored":["programs/task-65de1075.py"],"output":"0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 3 3 3 3 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0\n0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 3 3 3 3 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0\n0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 3 3 3 3 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0\n0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 3 3 3 3 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0\n8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8\n2 2 2 2 8 2 2 2 2 8 6 6 6 6 8 2 2 2 2 8 2 2 2 2 8 0 0 0\n2 2 2 2 8 2 2 2 2 8 6 6 6 6 8 2 2 2 2 8 2 2 2 2 8 0 0 0\n2 2 2 2 8 2 2 2 2 8 6 6 6 6 8 2 2 2 2 8 2 2 2 2 8 0 0 0\n2 2 2 2 8 2 2 2 2 8 6 6 6 6 8 2 2 2 2 8 2 2 2 2 8 0 0 0\n8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8\n2 2 2 2 8 0 0 0 0 8 3 3 3 3 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0\n2 2 2 2 8 0 0 0 0 8 3 3 3 3 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0\n2 2 2 2 8 0 0 0 0 8 3 3 3 3 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0\n2 2 2 2 8 0 0 0 0 8 3 3 3 3 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0\n8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8 8\n2 2 2 2 8 0 0 0 0 8 3 3 3 3 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0 0 8 0 0 0\n2 2 2 2 8 0 0